WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.799 --> 00:00:04.037
- There's been a secret under
the streets of Liverpool

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:06.417
for hundreds of years.

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:09.750
(soft electronic music)

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.549
A mysterious network of
tunnels, built 200 years ago,

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.046
and stretching out for miles, was built

00:00:19.046 --> 00:00:21.729
by eccentric and successful
tobacco merchant,

00:00:21.729 --> 00:00:23.229
Joseph Williamson.

00:00:24.351 --> 00:00:26.120
There's evidence of tunnels built

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.005
and then immediately
bricked back up again.

00:00:28.005 --> 00:00:30.160
And arches that lead to nowhere.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.381
But the purpose and the
reason behind building these

00:00:33.381 --> 00:00:37.040
is unknown, there's theories of course.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.679
One that he and his wife were part of

00:00:39.679 --> 00:00:42.220
an apocalyptic cult, and these tunnels

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:45.367
were to be their hideout.
Another that its only aim

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.680
was to provide jobs for
the men in the area,

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.920
to combat the high levels of unemployment.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.913
A final theory is they
were used for smuggling

00:00:52.913 --> 00:00:55.431
or other secret operations
by Williamson himself.

00:00:55.431 --> 00:00:59.860
Construction of the tunnels
stopped immediately

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:03.257
after Williamson's death, in May 1840,

00:01:03.257 --> 00:01:06.109
and it wasn't rediscovered until 2001.

00:01:06.109 --> 00:01:09.889
Since then, a team of local retirees

00:01:09.889 --> 00:01:13.300
has made it their mission
to excavate the tunnels,

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.521
but with no records to offer explanation,

00:01:15.521 --> 00:01:17.449
the purpose of the tunnels,

00:01:17.449 --> 00:01:19.931
or even a map of how far they span,

00:01:19.931 --> 00:01:23.779
has made it a mysterious and tough job.

00:01:23.779 --> 00:01:27.112
(soft electronic music)

